/T (These amphibians are highly playful and love swimming up and down natural waterfalls. But their curiosity can come with a price - lava falls are also common down below, and when the axolotls' playing gets too close... I saw several unlucky individuals meet an untimely end. Although they can regenerate, it can't save them from a near instant fiery death! )
